This is an application for creating astrophoto.

To get better result unlike standard camera. 

This app set max exposure time for your iPhone and blend images. You can manage ISO value and focus camera destination.

App includes 5 modes for photo:
• Sunrise/Sunset;
• Stars;
• Sky;
• Northern Lights;
• Lightning.
   - Mode for catch lightning (Every lightning will be on photo). 

After set timer exposure time and get result photo.

Create live-photo, GIF and videos with your photos!

You can:
* Modify the gradient border animation color;
* Set your photo or predefined background to animate borders around;
* Create live photos;
* Create GIFs;
* Create videos;
* Export them in your photo gallery;
* Use the live photo as wallpaper for your iPhone;
* Tap and hold your desk to see your live photo goes live!
